msgid "A subject-matter expert reviews the injected translated markdown for: - Clinical/technical accuracy of terminology - Preservation of meaning from the source - Cultural appropriateness for the target locale - Consistency with the domain glossary For WHO content: the SME verifies that normative statements (\"SHALL\", \"SHOULD\", \"MAY\") are translated with the correct force in the target language."
msgstr ""

