#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Verify that all msgid entries have msgstr translations. Partial translations are acceptable for initial submissions but must be flagged for follow-up. The coordinator checks: - % of strings translated - Any fuzzy-flagged entries - Missing critical sections"
msgstr ""

